  <ownedComment xmi:id="_PYzzH8qDEfGXI-EA0I8zMA">
    <body>ICONIX robustness analysis stereotypes. Boundary = screen/API the actor touches; Control = a piece of behavior (a verb); Entity = a domain class. Rules: actors talk only to boundaries; boundaries talk to controls; entities talk only to controls (no noun-to-noun links).</body>
  </ownedComment>
